              <ns0:THE-VALUE><html:div><html:strong>Control Systems:</html:strong> Flight control systems must operate easily, smoothly, and positively. Must be designed to minimize jamming, chafing, and interference. Redundancy and failure modes analysis required for fly-by-wire systems.</html:div></ns0:THE-VALUE>
