              <ns0:THE-VALUE><html:div><html:strong>Landing Gear:</html:strong> Landing gear must be designed for all loading conditions including ground loads, tire failures, and retraction/extension cycles. Position indicating systems, braking systems, and steering systems requirements.</html:div></ns0:THE-VALUE>
