              <ns0:THE-VALUE><html:div><html:strong>Flight Crew Alerting:</html:strong> Warning, caution, and advisory alerts must be provided to the flightcrew. Must be prioritized appropriately and designed to minimize flightcrew errors. Red = Warning (immediate action), Amber = Caution (awareness/action), Blue/Green/White = Advisory.</html:div></ns0:THE-VALUE>
