              <ns0:THE-VALUE><html:div><html:strong>§25.1195 Fire Extinguishing Systems:</html:strong> Each designated fire zone must have a fire extinguisher system, except for certain turbine engine sections. Agent quantity, discharge rate, and distribution must adequately extinguish fires.</html:div></ns0:THE-VALUE>
